OL,3,ATrump says he can do business with
OL,4,ABurnham but criticises 'terrible'
OL,5,AChagos deal
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump says UK Prime
OL,8,FMinister Andy Burnham is a man he can
OL,9,Fdo business with, after they meet for
OL,10,Fthe first time in New York
OL,12,FHe also criticises the UK's plan to
OL,13,Fhand sovereignty of the Chagos Islands
OL,14,Fto Mauritius - the islands are home to
OL,15,Fa joint US-UK military base
OL,17,FAsked about UK's decision to introduce
OL,18,Fsanctions over illegal Israeli
OL,19,Fsettlements in the West Bank, Burnham
OL,20,Fsays they had to act
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
