OL,3,ATrump says he can do business with
OL,4,ABurnham but criticises 'terrible'
OL,5,AChagos deal
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe pair held a news conference after
OL,8,Fmeeting on the sidelines of the UN
OL,9,FGeneral Assembly - watch our coverage
OL,10,Flive at the top of the page
OL,12,FTrump has also met President Zelensky
OL,13,Fon the sidelines
OL,15,FEarlier, Trump warned Iran it could
OL,16,Fface "annihilation" without a US deal -
OL,17,Falthough he said he believed an
OL,18,Fagreement would be made after US
OL,19,Fmid-term elections in November
