OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Ukraine, Trump again claimed an end
OL,8,Fto the war with Russia is near - while
OL,9,Fhe also said the US will rename AI as
OL,10,F"super intelligence"
OL,12,FNearly 130 heads of state and
OL,13,Fgovernment attend the annual week-long
OL,14,Fevent to deliver a message from their
OL,15,Fnation to the world
